title: "grazing-control-sim: rotational grazing as a control loop, live simulation"
version: 1.5.0
date-released: 2026-10-14
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Koc
    given-names: Ali Bulent
    affiliation: "Clemson University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/alibulentkoc/grazing-control-sim"
abstract: "Design-stage teaching tool. Simulates a ten-paddock rotational grazing system one day at a time, with noisy sensors, an estimator, and move rules, and replays field records through the same estimator and rules. Results with placeholder parameters are not field results."
keywords:
  - rotational grazing
  - control loop
  - digital twin
  - forage biomass
  - walk-over weighing
